            {"h": "Dig for Aces and low cards first", "p": ["Look at the deal before you touch anything. Find where the four Aces and the 2s are buried, and count how many cards sit on top of each. Start with the column that frees the most important cards for the least effort.", "Low cards matter because they unlock the foundations, and the foundations are what empty the board. A 2 stuck under five cards can freeze a whole suit."]},
